Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.91,0:00:02.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這是被封印的力量！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.50,0:00:06.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,封印在你體內的黑暗之力\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.13,0:00:08.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就要覺醒了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.75,0:00:12.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,既然這樣 那莉露就要用這股力量…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.51,0:00:15.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,幫上村裡大家的忙！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.60,0:00:22.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露 這股力量要保密\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.19,0:00:25.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼啊？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.61,0:00:31.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,叫做祕密力量\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.90,0:00:33.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不是比較帥嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:35.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,也對！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.99,0:00:39.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我還有一點剩下的工作要做\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.54,0:00:42.12,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好的唷！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.38,0:00:50.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（29歲單身中堅冒險家的日常）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.42,0:00:51.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,往那邊去了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.63,0:00:52.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,從後面包抄！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.09,0:00:54.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,知道了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.38,0:00:56.72,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真忙啊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.39,0:00:58.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不過\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.05,0:01:00.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,沒辦法啊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.91,0:01:25.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.22,0:01:41.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你這臭小鬼！給我站住！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.15,0:01:54.44,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你們這種傢伙哪抓得到我\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.86,0:01:58.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可惡 肚子好餓啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.70,0:02:01.32,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 你又跑去大鬧了嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.08,0:02:05.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞奇！布比！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.87,0:02:10.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（第12話 故鄉與夥伴）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.04,0:02:12.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 不可以這樣啦始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.34,0:02:16.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就是說啊！要鬧事也要先叫上我們！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.55,0:02:18.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思不好意思\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.93,0:02:20.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.22,0:02:24.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,老鼠肉烤好了喔！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.14,0:02:30.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你吃太多了啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.98,0:02:33.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,明明就只有一隻而已耶！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.90,0:02:42.32,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可惡 肚子餓死了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.70,0:02:44.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那一點點哪夠塞牙縫啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.87,0:02:46.87,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,別說出來 越講越餓\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.04,0:02:50.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這種時候就來聊夢想吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.08,0:02:54.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就是將來想變成什麼那種啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.71,0:02:56.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什麼？我哪知道！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.05,0:02:58.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,總之我啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.17,0:03:00.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,只想吃好吃的吃到撐啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.26,0:03:02.89,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真像始會說的話！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.18,0:03:04.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那布比呢？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.76,0:03:07.72,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我以後想結婚…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.10,0:03:09.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,結… 婚？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.60,0:03:11.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,有個叫薇洛妮卡的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.27,0:03:13.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,很可愛的女孩子喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.36,0:03:15.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這夢想不錯耶！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.65,0:03:16.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯嗯\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.73,0:03:17.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞奇呢？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.82,0:03:21.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我要當駐村冒險者！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.45,0:03:22.74,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,駐村？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.07,0:03:25.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就是成為村子的一分子\n在村裡工作的冒險者\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.33,0:03:28.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你幹嘛想當那種東西啊？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.45,0:03:31.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我要打造自己的故鄉\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.08,0:03:34.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不是這種像垃圾堆一樣的地方喔！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.00,0:03:36.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,最好有很多大自然！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.38,0:03:42.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,然後大家互相幫忙 彼此扶持\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.97,0:03:44.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我要讓整個村子\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.14,0:03:46.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,都像我們這樣…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.06,0:03:48.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是夥伴一樣的關係 ！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.22,0:03:50.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真不錯 感覺很開心！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.56,0:03:55.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我還是不太懂\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.81,0:04:32.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,原來是這樣啊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.14,0:04:35.44,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,所以一定會生意爆好的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.52,0:04:37.94,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,超級帥氣攤位就要完成啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.23,0:04:40.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好厲害喔！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.53,0:04:42.69,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,也得準備串燒才行\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.03,0:04:44.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.29,0:04:55.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,誰快來啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.34,0:05:08.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,尿尿\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.81,0:05:13.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這樣就不會被發現了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.86,0:05:26.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好險好險啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.58,0:05:32.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那是？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.34,0:05:41.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始先生\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.09,0:05:44.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了？這麼早就醒來了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.71,0:05:45.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可以打擾一下嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.55,0:05:47.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我有事想問\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.39,0:05:50.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好 想問什麼都行\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.14,0:05:53.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是關於莉露的事\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.85,0:05:58.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,她手臂上有我沒看過的紋樣在發光…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.11,0:06:02.32,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,古代種的事\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.48,0:06:04.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我雖然不是很清楚…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.90,0:06:07.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但莉露她是不是發生了什麼事？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.41,0:06:10.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,她看起來和平常沒兩樣啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.03,0:06:12.87,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,村長也有交代過\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.08,0:06:14.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,只要有一點可疑的事\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.91,0:06:16.54,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,都要上報\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.25,0:06:18.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,說不定\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.46,0:06:21.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這和最近夜裡魔獸會跑來有關\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.51,0:06:29.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這場騷動\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.68,0:06:31.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,和莉露沒有任何關係\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.15,0:06:46.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,明明知道\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.23,0:06:48.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,最近這場騷動的原因就是莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.49,0:06:50.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始先生卻選擇隱瞞？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.95,0:06:54.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這要是讓村裡大家知道的話…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.58,0:06:56.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.70,0:06:59.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,把麻煩鬼趕出去 真了不起啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.58,0:07:00.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,幹得好喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.33,0:07:04.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸你這冷血怪！對牠好一點啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.80,0:07:07.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,因為老鼠本來就是害獸啊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.05,0:07:11.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,早安\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.22,0:07:13.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,東雲先生呢？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.76,0:07:15.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,奧利弗小姐 那個\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.77,0:07:19.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始還在睡喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.56,0:07:21.44,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,也是呢…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.60,0:07:24.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,晚上很辛苦嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.15,0:07:29.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 目前正在查明原因\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.94,0:07:30.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這樣啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.20,0:07:32.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.74,0:07:33.87,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.95,0:07:35.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你們是在準備祭典嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.62,0:07:36.79,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,請加油喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.54,0:07:38.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大姐姐也要\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.58,0:07:41.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,來吃莉露我們的攤子喔！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.71,0:07:44.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊 我很期待！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.01,0:07:50.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那我再過來喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.05,0:07:54.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那個 你找始先生是…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.39,0:07:57.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想說\n他最近是不是有什麼煩惱\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.35,0:07:59.97,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,到目前為止 東雲先生\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.06,0:08:01.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,已經替大家扛了很多東西\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.19,0:08:04.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,受了他那麼多照顧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.81,0:08:06.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我們也想回報他一點啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.19,0:08:09.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,像是失去手臂那件事\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.94,0:08:12.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,他明明可以對我們更生氣一點…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.86,0:08:16.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,雖然那個人自己沒發現\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.32,0:08:18.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但他實在太溫柔了啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.46,0:08:25.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那個 奧利弗小姐\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.67,0:08:26.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什麼事？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.25,0:08:30.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,看招！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.76,0:08:40.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,給我適可而止！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.23,0:08:45.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是因為明天滿月的關係嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.98,0:08:47.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,數量變多了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.86,0:08:56.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,連凶性都變強了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.12,0:08:58.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 沒完沒了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.34,0:09:09.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始先生\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.55,0:09:16.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你為什麼不肯找我商量？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.01,0:09:19.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你是覺得我會丟下莉露不管嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.93,0:09:21.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我有這麼不值得你信任嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.31,0:09:24.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,話說回來 東雲先生那隻手的事\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.06,0:09:26.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,痛痛痛！！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.14,0:09:28.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要是莉露出了什麼問題\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.40,0:09:30.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,第一個就該先來找我商量\n你這個笨蛋！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.23,0:09:33.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你從以前就是這樣 老愛獨斷獨行\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.36,0:09:36.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你現在身邊還帶著小孩子\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.20,0:09:37.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,給我成熟一點啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.95,0:09:40.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你在說什麼啊？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.12,0:09:41.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,對不起！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.41,0:09:42.49,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露的事\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.79,0:09:44.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我已經告訴村裡大家了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.63,0:09:53.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,而且 大家也都已經決定了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.51,0:09:59.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露她\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.72,0:10:01.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就由村裡大家一起保護！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.64,0:10:07.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,古代種年幼時失控的情況\n本來就不算少見\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.31,0:10:09.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,只要這段時期過去\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.40,0:10:11.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好像自然就會平息喔？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.90,0:10:12.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是這樣啊？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.40,0:10:16.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,總之 先撐過今天這個滿月吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.70,0:10:17.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這樣一來\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.86,0:10:20.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,力量失控應該暫時就不會再發作了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.95,0:10:23.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天是鹿神祭\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.83,0:10:25.12,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不只是莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.20,0:10:27.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,也要讓孩子們都能好好享受祭典\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.71,0:10:30.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,整個村子都會一起努力喔 始小弟！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.63,0:10:34.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我要讓整個村子\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.92,0:10:36.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,都像我們這樣…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.84,0:10:38.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是夥伴一樣的關係 ！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.81,0:10:47.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,天亮了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.06,0:10:49.27,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,差不多該…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.44,0:10:56.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.07,0:11:02.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（29歲單身中堅冒險家的日常）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.05,0:11:18.72,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露不見了？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.80,0:11:21.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我們也來幫忙找！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.68,0:11:22.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.84,0:11:23.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,等等！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.01,0:11:27.27,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你們兩個可以留下來顧攤子嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.60,0:11:29.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.14,0:11:30.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,沒有莉露的祭典\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.73,0:11:32.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,根本一點都不好玩啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.15,0:11:34.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露的話\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.31,0:11:35.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始先生一定會找到她的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.65,0:11:38.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,因為他是駐村冒險者啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.15,0:11:40.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可是…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.65,0:11:43.32,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,而且 攤子要是不熱鬧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.57,0:11:45.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,等莉露回來的時候\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.37,0:11:46.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不是會很落寞嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.50,0:11:52.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.50,0:11:54.67,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可可…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.64,0:12:09.97,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.18,0:12:12.89,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可惡 跑到村外了嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.65,0:12:15.02,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,到底該怎麼辦…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.05,0:12:49.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我要第一個衝進祭典會場！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.73,0:12:54.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,駐村冒險者那邊的孩子？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.73,0:12:56.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 應該不會錯\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.40,0:13:00.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,受到莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.73,0:13:02.49,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,古代種力量的影響\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.03,0:13:04.32,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天就算是白天\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.57,0:13:06.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,也有可能會聚集魔獸\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.28,0:13:12.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道大家連日來\n都為了魔獸入侵都忙得很…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.16,0:13:14.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但還是希望\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.37,0:13:16.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,各位白天也能幫忙戒備\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.63,0:13:24.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,每個晚上村子都…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.51,0:13:27.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始這麼辛苦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.93,0:13:29.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是因為莉露？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.06,0:13:31.97,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,晚上很辛苦嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.47,0:13:35.69,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 目前正在查明原因\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.73,0:13:39.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大姐姐說過 白天也會有魔獸過來…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.69,0:13:41.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要是魔獸跑進村子\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.27,0:13:44.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,祭典就會被弄得亂七八糟…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.61,0:13:47.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露不能待在村子裡！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.37,0:13:56.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,安揚戈 可可… 對不起\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.62,0:13:58.54,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不能跟你們一起顧攤子了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.50,0:14:00.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,因為只要莉露在\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.92,0:14:03.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就會給大家添麻煩…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.24,0:14:34.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.89,0:15:01.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,痛痛痛…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.46,0:15:22.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,還… 還沒完啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.59,0:15:25.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.30,0:15:28.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,冒險者絕對不會放棄的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.68,0:15:36.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,龍？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.08,0:15:56.12,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大家…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.42,0:16:10.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你這笨蛋 害我忙成這樣！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.88,0:16:12.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,多依靠我一點啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.26,0:16:15.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟我不是夥伴嗎！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.01,0:16:20.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要當我的夥伴就不准哭！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.35,0:16:23.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.65,0:16:27.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露 你想怎麼做？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.36,0:16:29.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.11,0:16:33.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露想跟始 還有村裡的大家\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.86,0:16:36.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,一起參加祭典！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.20,0:16:39.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要當我的夥伴就不准哭\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.42,0:16:48.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.13,0:16:51.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,辛苦啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.76,0:16:55.97,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,月亮也開始缺角了 應該沒事了吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.34,0:16:59.97,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好睏\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.06,0:17:01.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我可是熬了一整夜耶\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.14,0:17:03.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.02,0:17:06.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,祭典還在辦嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.02,0:17:08.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,別擔心\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.36,0:17:12.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,回村子吧 大家都在等你喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.20,0:17:15.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.91,0:17:18.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,快點啦！快走啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.87,0:17:21.79,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,別拉我！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.70,0:17:24.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,路上小心\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.25,0:17:25.54,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,路上小心！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.10,0:17:43.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,安揚戈 可可…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.39,0:17:46.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露來晚了 對不起！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.86,0:17:54.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,太慢啦 莉露！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.53,0:17:59.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,看起來好好吃喔！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.62,0:18:04.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,接下來就交給你囉\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.33,0:18:07.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,來 莉露 快烤啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.67,0:18:10.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大家都在等著吃你的串燒耶！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.09,0:18:15.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可以來一串嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.09,0:18:17.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,等很久囉\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.55,0:18:19.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,也給我們一份！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.51,0:18:21.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露 我也想吃！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.15,0:18:31.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,歡迎光臨！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.89,0:19:02.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大家！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.89,0:19:04.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（鹿神祭導覽員　鹿丸君）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.43,0:19:05.97,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是鹿丸君喔！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.60,0:19:10.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝大家跳得這麼賣力！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.10,0:19:13.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大家的能量 我都收到了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.27,0:19:15.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,希望明年大家也能…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.03,0:19:18.74,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,吃到滿滿的飯！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.95,0:20:09.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今年發生了好多事啊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.85,0:20:30.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這叫幸運星\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.56,0:20:32.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,會在祭典的最後墜落喔！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.11,0:20:42.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露也要帶一份給始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.62,0:20:50.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我果然還是不太懂\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.33,0:20:55.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,像是什麼故鄉啊 很多夥伴啊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.63,0:20:58.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,對我來說 有你們就夠了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.30,0:21:05.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,謝啦！對我來說你們也是最重要的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.43,0:21:08.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那就三個人一起吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.85,0:21:12.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,成為駐村冒險者 在故鄉\n和大家一起\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.52,0:21:15.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,每天一定都會很開心！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.61,0:21:26.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,痛耶！誰啊混帳\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.79,0:21:36.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,-椅子！\n-是！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.08,0:21:39.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,-謝謝您\n-欸 莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.88,0:21:40.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.21,0:21:43.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,每天都過得開心嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.55,0:21:49.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,非常非常開心喔！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.27,0:23:18.27,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,路上小心！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.98,0:23:20.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好\n
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.56,0:23:23.82,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露 走吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.28,0:23:29.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,出發啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.53,0:23:35.74,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那今天也悠悠哉哉地\n
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.08,0:23:38.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,開工吧\n
